            <ArticleTitle>Correction to: Norwegian reference values for the Short-Form Health Survey 36: development over time.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s11136-017-1708-0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the original publication of the article, the right number of participants included in the analysis should be 2107 and not 2118 as written in the paper. The flow-chart and corrected SF-36 scores for the 2015 data set for this article should have appeared as follows: Fig. 1 and Table 3. These changes did not influence the results. The authors would like to apologize for any inconvenience caused.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
